{{Quote|Jabba's Palace is on the far side of the Dune Sea. We'd better hurry if we're gonna make it by morning.|[[Anakin Skywalker]], to [[Ahsoka Tano]]|<ref name="TCW Movie">[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars (film)|''Star Wars: The Clone Wars'' film]]</ref>}}
The '''Northern Dune Sea''' was a region of the [[Dune Sea]], a large expanse of [[desert]] on the [[Outer Rim Territories|Outer Rim]] [[Planet|world]] of [[Tatooine]]. The [[Boba Fett's Palace|palace]] of [[Jabba Desilijic Tiure|Jabba]] the [[Hutt]] was one of the most prominent features in the Northern Dune Sea,<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars" /> with another being the [[Great Pit of Carkoon]] and the [[Sarlacc]] that resides in it.<ref name="Fancy Man" />

